      "content": "the \"professional\" stuff doesn't really change the reality of it though. it doesn't make the house cleaner or stop the constant noise. it just feels like i'm running a race where the finish line keeps moving further away. i’m just so incredibly tired of fighting it every single day. sometimes i just sit here staring at the wall and think about how much easier it would be if i could just go to sleep and not have to deal with any of this ever again.",
